# Local XAMPP MySQL (copy to .env — .env is gitignored).
# Django 5.2+/6 officially need MySQL 8.0+ or MariaDB 10.5+.
# Stock XAMPP 8.2 ships MariaDB 10.4 — set the relax flag for local only.
DB_ENGINE=django.db.backends.mysql
DB_NAME=anticheat_exam
DB_USER=root
DB_PASSWORD=
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DJANGO_RELAX_MYSQL_VERSION=1

# Optional hosted override (Railway). When set, this wins over DB_* above.
# DATABASE_URL=mysql://user:pass@host:3306/anticheat_exam
